   "text": "Latent logit\nz = a_q·θ_m − b_q\n     + γ·g([a_q, θ_m, a_q⊙θ_m, r_q])\n(γ starts at 0 → pure IRT)\nInteractionLayer (components.py)",
   "originalText": "Latent logit\nz = a_q·θ_m − b_q\n     + γ·g([a_q, θ_m, a_q⊙θ_m, r_q])\n(γ starts at 0 → pure IRT)\nInteractionLayer (components.py)",
