   "text": "Decide\nm̂(q) = argmax_m [ quality_qm − λ · cost_qm ]\nnon-finite cells → −∞;  exact ties → first column\nλ = 0: best predicted quality; larger λ: cheaper\nrouter/nirt/routing_decision.py\n· cost_aware_utility, routing_decision",
   "originalText": "Decide\nm̂(q) = argmax_m [ quality_qm − λ · cost_qm ]\nnon-finite cells → −∞;  exact ties → first column\nλ = 0: best predicted quality; larger λ: cheaper\nrouter/nirt/routing_decision.py\n· cost_aware_utility, routing_decision",
